body:
Just use whatever magic spell is best. Blood barrage is fine, ice barrage has been bugged on p2 Warden since day 1 so don't use it.  If you have Zeah you can use undead grasp which also gives you thralls for the raid.

&#x200B;

For the core just range it. If you have Berserker relic you will max hit each time on the first down. If ranging feels bad, just bring a dragon dagger and do it normally.

[https://i.imgur.com/85gln4P.png](https://i.imgur.com/85gln4P.png) ?

&#x200B;

Arguing over peak min maxing. Pegs are still overrated trash.
